              "metadata": {
                "price": "$109/month",
                "best_for": "Regular lifters",
                "highlight": "Most Popular"
              }
            },
            {
              "title": "Elite Lifter",
              "description": "Everything in Iron Member plus two 1-on-1 coaching sessions per month, personalized programming, and nutrition guidance from our certified coaches.",
              "metadata": {
                "price": "$189/month",
                "best_for": "Serious athletes",
                "highlight": "Best Results"
              }
            }
          ],
          "ctas": [
            {
              "label": "Start With a Free Session",
              "target_page": "book"
            }
          ],
          "asset_ideas": []
        },
        {
          "id": "pricing-section-3",
          "type": "faq",
          "intent": "Address the most common pricing objections and questions to reduce friction and give visitors the confidence to sign up.",
          "eyebrow": "Common Questions",
          "headline": "Got Questions? We've Got Answers.",
          "subheadline": null,
          "body": null,
          "items": [
            {
              "title": "Is there a joining fee?",
              "description": "Nope. No joining fee, no setup fee, no surprises. You pay your monthly rate and that's it.",
              "metadata": {}
            },
            {
              "title": "Can I freeze or cancel my membership?",
              "description": "Yes. You can freeze your membership for up to 2 months per year and cancel with 30 days' notice \u2014 no questions asked.",
              "metadata": {}
            },
            {
              "title": "Do programs cost extra?",
              "description": "Structured programs like Barbell Basics and Pop Powerlifting are included in all memberships. 1-on-1 coaching is available as an add-on or included in the Elite Lifter plan.",
              "metadata": {}
            },
            {
              "title": "What does the free session include?",
              "description": "A 45-minute coached session, a tour of the gym, and a quick goal-setting chat with one of our coaches. No sales pressure \u2014 just lifting.",
              "metadata": {}
            }
          ],
          "ctas": [],
          "asset_ideas": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "slug": "stories",
      "title": "Stories",
      "role": "editorial",
